      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOUTHBROOK MERV (6) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 2 lengths away in second (18.67) at this track in a Grade 4 over 318m. Expected to feature in the finish again. ADA TARO (1) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 18.38 beating Cindy's Secret. Nicely placed here on the inside and likes the trip. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Will go close again if runs up to latest. GREENER PASTURES (4) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (18.68) at this track. One of the better chances. CHARGE THE CARD (8) did a good job to finish third last time out over 318m at this track (18.71) in a Grade 4, the second top-three finish on the trot. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw.",
